// A story with a typed signature, run as a function (T5.2, REQ-BEH-2, REQ-AUTO-5).
//
// This flow has no run block, so `yam run` runs nothing from it: a `story`
// block outside a run block is a function waiting to be called, not a test
// (REQ-LANG-10). It is invoked by name —
//
//   yam workflow run "Book a slot" --input location=Indiranagar
//
// — and by the tool server over MCP (T5.3), which derives the tool's schema from
// the signature below.
//
// `idempotent` because booking the same slot twice on the sample application
// leaves it in the same state: the page is static. A story that made a real
// booking would not carry it, and the environment policy would refuse to run it
// against production without `--allow-side-effects` (REQ-AUTO-7).

story (idempotent=true, tags=workflow): Book a slot
inputs: location: string, date: string = "2026-09-03"
outputs: booking: string, place: string
  Click the Book a slot link
  Type {input.location} into the location field
  Type {input.date} into the slot date field
  Click the next button
  Click the Book now button
  Remember the text of the booking result as booking
  Remember the value of the location field as place

// The same shape without `idempotent`, for the environment policy: booking a
// slot is safe to repeat on a static page, but paying for one is not, and a
// production config must refuse this one without an explicit override.
story (tags=workflow): Pay for a slot
inputs: card: secret
outputs: paid: string
  Click the Book a slot link
  Click the Checkout link
  Type {input.card} into the card number field
  Remember the value of the card number field as paid
